WEBVTT

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:14.630
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:18.870
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:22.280
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.310
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:29.250
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.200
<i>He's coming!</i>

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.830
<i>Daddy! Welcome home!</i>

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:45.000
<i>Welcome home, dear.</i>

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:47.240
<i>l'm back.</i>

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:52.670
<i>To fight off the fear,</i>

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:59.020
<i>and fend off the misfortunes,</i> <i>so more people can be happy...</i>

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:03.720
<i>that is what this power exists for.</i>

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:07.160
Victoria...

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:10.860
Alexandria...

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:37.680
Buso Renkin of the Missile Launcher,
Extermination Circus!

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.840
All shots from the Extermination Circus have hit the target!

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:57.110
Did that do it?!

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:58.840
No, not yet.

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:02.740
lf it ended that easily, we wouldn't have to go through this trouble.

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:12.620
No way. He's unhurt...?!

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.560
Continue the attack while keeping your distance!

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:19.070
We will drive Victor into Point A-205!

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:20.100
Roger!

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:22.560
l'm counting on all of you!

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:33.510
lt's futile...

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:42.090
Quite a few of you gathered while l was asleep?

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:51.300
l see. So that is their plan...

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:56.630
Very well. I'll fall into your trap...

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.010
Victor is coming!

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:08.450
Are you guys prepared?

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:09.580
Absolutely.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:10.980
You need not say that.

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:13.320
We will follow your lead without question, sir.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:16.650
The world will be saved if we can just defeat Victor.

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:19.690
Heh. lsn't it great? lt's pure and simple.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.860
There's nothing absurd about this.

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:26.930
lf we beat him, we will be the saviors of this world!

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:35.110
lnukai, Maruyama. l think you guys know, but...

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.100
You don't need to tell us.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.280
We know because we've already fought him once.

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:44.810
He's not an opponent we can beat with the power of just one.

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:46.320
Good, then.

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:50.310
We'll hurl all of our power at him!

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:53.250
Buso Renkin!

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:03.770
All Alchemist Warriors will be killed.

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:06.140
You are prepared, are you not?

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:10.180
Let's go, you bastards!

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:15.840
<i>A Decision is Required</i>

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:21.180
This is the Newton Apple Girls' Academy.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:25.350
The person who knows about the black kakugane is in here somewhere.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.090
Let's go!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.090
Right!

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:30.530
You sure took your time.

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:33.290
l was getting tired of waiting.

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:35.790
Chono! What're you doing here?

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:39.870
l heard you guys were being chased.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:43.470
l came with this guy to check things out.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:44.570
Kazukin!

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:49.740
l missed you, Kazukin!
You had it so rough!

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:50.780
—l-l can't breathe...
—Kazukin!

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.190
Who're these guys?

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.120
We don't have the time to chat with you!

00:04:58.990 --> 00:04:59.480
Oww!

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:02.020
lf it's your intention to interfere...!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:03.700
Ow-ow...!

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:04.990
Hold it, Tokiko.

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:10.260
Angel Gozen is with him.
Chono hasn't come to interfere with us.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:16.300
That's right, Tsumurin!
Pappi came to help you guys!

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:19.140
He even took out some Alchemist Warriors!

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:22.110
<i>Muto, Tsumura,</i>

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:25.980
<i>we got a general idea of things</i> <i>by hacking into the Army's computer.</i>

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:27.780
<i>Let's hurry on.</i>

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:31.250
l see. So that's it, huh?

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:35.950
l'm glad to see you're safe.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.700
Yeah, same goes for you...

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:41.400
Tokiko! Look at that!

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:48.130
Who's that...?

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:51.480
lt's the person l told you about before who was in the underground room.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.680
This is sure a quick greeting...

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:02.080
Good grief...

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:15.900
Damn it! What's with this guy?!
He's running all over the place!

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:17.840
Stop complaining, Gota.

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:21.300
That's exactly what we came here to find out!

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:33.410
lt's a dead-end up ahead!
This game of tag is over.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.460
A student...?

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:46.200
Hey, did someone suspicious come through here?

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:49.160
No, this girl is totally suspicious.

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.530
That's right. l can tell by the smell.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.200
She's a Homunculus.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:55.940
—A Homunculus?!
—A Homunculus?!

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:02.520
I'll show you the way, Kazuki Muto.

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:05.710
No, you're Victor III now, aren't you?

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.450
Come with me. This is the entrance.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.890
My mom is waiting right there.

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:19.920
We'll tell you about your fate...

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:22.670
Buso Renkin of the Military Dog!

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.430
Killer Rabies!

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.370
Secret Trail!

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:33.040
lt's futile.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.410
His weapon split into two?!

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:37.610
A Double Axe?!

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:38.780
There!

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:40.580
Reverse-Do!

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:43.190
l told you it's futile!

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:47.860
Killer Rabies!

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.030
Bubble Cage!

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:51.300
Enough!

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.480
ls he controlling gravity again?!

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:08.280
W-We can't get close!

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:10.850
You guys carry the wounded and fall back!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.450
Busujima! You're on!

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:14.890
Y-Yes, sir!

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:17.190
Aerial Operator!

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.000
lt's not poison gas. This is...

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:25.520
lt's oxygen.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:26.690
What?!

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:29.830
lf my flames are added to Busujima's oxygen,

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.740
the destructive force becomes ten or twenty times larger.

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:38.670
Sorry, man.
Unlike you, we're not alone...

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.910
Burn, Victor!

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:44.480
Oxygen Blaze of Glory!

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:10.400
What?!

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:12.940
ls he charred? No!

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:15.010
His skin color has changed...!

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.260
Victor is in stage three!

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:32.100
Has he progressed to the next stage in the same way

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:35.000
that Victor III advanced into stages one and two?!

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:40.770
All vessels retreat to beyond a radius of three kilometers from Victor!

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:44.740
Please send the helicopter unit to rescue Hiwatari and the others.

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:46.140
—Yes, sir!
—Yes, sir!

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:50.380
l will now be taking separate action.

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:51.540
What?!

00:09:51.850 --> 00:09:52.880
Don't tell me...

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:54.910
Great Warrior Chief!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:04.190
<i>How many casualties will there</i> <i>be from here on?</i>

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:13.100
The location of the entrance is different from last time...

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:16.240
We periodically change the location.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:18.270
Things would get troublesome if we were discovered...

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:21.550
My Buso Renkin, the Underground Searchlight,

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:26.250
has the ability to build shelters in walls and on the ground.

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:31.220
There's no way we can be found if l close the entrance.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.230
Whoa! That's awesome...

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:41.000
She doesn't have much design sense, though.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.700
What a weird Buso Renkin.

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:45.870
l mean, can this even be considered as a Buso?

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:47.240
You're one to be saying that!

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:50.240
We're here. This is the place.

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:03.860
Huh? What's this?

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.820
Agh! Brains!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:08.230
There are brains everywhere!
This is scary!

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:09.730
This is...

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:11.360
ls it an AI?

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:12.360
<i>You are incorrect.</i>

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:16.400
<i>l am not artificial intelligence.</i>

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:21.400
<i>Pleased to meet you.</i> <i>l am Victor's wife, Alexandria.</i>

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:24.780
<i>l am the developer of</i> <i>the black kakugane.</i>

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:29.640
<i>And that child is our daughter, Victoria.</i>

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.950
Victor's wife and daughter.

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:35.980
This is the identity of the person in the mask.

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:38.360
But, why are you...?

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:40.560
lf you've got something to talk about with Muto,

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.220
get a move on, brain.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:43.160
Chono!

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.200
Be a bit more creative with the name calling!

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:46.760
<i>You are right.</i>

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:51.400
<i>l will tell you about everything</i> <i>we have done thus far.</i>

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:56.840
<i>We conducted research here</i> <i>for many years.</i>

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:01.410
<i>Of course, it is not research done</i> <i>for your sake.</i>

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:07.150
<i>However, it is the only research</i> <i>that can turn you back into a human.</i>

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:14.260
l knew it. So your objective is to turn Victor back to human, right?

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:15.950
—Victor back to human?!
—Victor back to human?!

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:19.200
<i>You are very perceptive.</i>
<i>That is exactly right.</i>

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:20.600
Then that means...

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:22.330
You're so naÏve.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:30.140
Do you think alchemy can make everyone happy that easily?

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:40.990
Do you think alchemy can make everyone happy that easily?

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:46.460
Hey...What do you mean by that?!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:48.390
<i>Now, Victoria!</i>

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:51.290
You don't need to rush.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.800
You'll understand if you listen to what my mother has to say.

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:55.030
<i>Victoria?</i>

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:59.340
l did what l was told.
Now you're free to do whatever.

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:02.040
You know l hate everything about alchemy

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:06.170
just like Daddy does, right Mama?

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:10.880
lt makes me sick just being with an Alchemist Warrior!

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:15.050
What's with her?!

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:16.990
She's so full of herself considering she's so small!

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:20.060
Those are not words you should be uttering.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:37.800
lt's the Energy Drain!

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:39.710
lt's on a whole different level than before!

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:42.340
Move further away!
We'll be killed instantly!

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:43.670
Hold it.

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:45.280
That voice...

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:53.260
l will be your opponent.

00:13:58.930 --> 00:13:59.760
That is...

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:01.800
Take a good look.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:03.030
Warrior Chief Hiwatari!

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:07.130
This is the Great Warrior Chief
Shousei Sakaguchi's Buso Renkin...

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:20.650
Full Plate Armor Buso Renkin!

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:22.420
Buster Baron!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:42.330
<i>A hundred years ago,</i>

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:47.780
<i>a great battle continued between</i> <i>the Alchemist Army and the Homunculi.</i>

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:53.610
At that time, my husband Victor was the most powerful warrior in the Army.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:59.660
However, he was gravely injured in a battle against the Homunculi.

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:04.390
There was no other way to save his life.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.700
We transplanted a Philosopher's Stone into his body.

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:12.900
No, a black kakugane that was still in the midst of research...

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:19.740
You all know... what the result of that was...

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:28.390
What l saw within my fading consciousness...

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:31.950
was the mountain of rubble, the bodies of my comrades

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:34.930
and the tear-streaked face of the being that was once my husband.

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:45.560
<i>l lost all function from my neck down</i>

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:48.230
<i>and did not regain consciousness</i> <i>for seven years.</i>

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:51.580
<i>What l saw when</i> <i>l woke up was my daughter...</i>

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:56.950
<i>who had ceased to be human</i> <i>caring for me all by herself.</i>

00:15:57.590 --> 00:16:00.050
Why did your daughter turn into a Homunculus?

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:05.580
<i>l do not know why.</i>
<i>She woud not tell me.</i>

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:10.820
There's no point in listening about a brain's life story.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.190
More importantly, tell us about the results of the research.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:18.170
How do we turn those who have been "Victorized" back to normal?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:19.610
<i>Very well.</i>

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.340
<i>ln the turmoil that followed,</i>

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:25.540
<i>we stole the two remaining</i> <i>black kakugane,</i>

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:29.080
<i>came to this country where</i> <i>my husband was last seen,</i>

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.410
<i>and began our research.</i>

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:34.050
<i>l discarded my body that was</i> <i>no longer of any use</i>

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:38.020
<i>and connected cloned brains</i> <i>to magnify my intellect.</i>

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:40.760
<i>After 100 years,</i>

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:44.060
<i>we have a prototype that controls</i> <i>the power of the black kakugane</i>

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:47.620
<i>and returns it to the same power</i> <i>as ordinary kakugane.</i>

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:50.290
<i>ln other words,</i>

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:52.770
<i>that one you recovered that's inside</i> <i>your chest right now...</i>

00:16:57.980 --> 00:17:00.500
<i>The results were supposed</i> <i>to have been positive,</i>

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:01.910
<i>so l relinquished it.</i>

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:07.550
<i>But it seems that when you collided</i> <i>with Victor the fail safe was damaged.</i>

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:10.920
"lt seems" my butt, you quack!

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.120
Because of that, Kazukin was...!

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.290
lt's okay, Angel Gozen.

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:17.160
And then, what happened after that?

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:21.930
<i>We continued research using data</i> <i>from that prototype as a base...</i>

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:24.600
<i>We are now just one step away</i> <i>from completion.</i>

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.070
What the--?!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:38.750
This is...!

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:42.420
The white kakugane.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:46.220
lt will nullify all the power of the black kakugane!

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:50.350
Then if we use this, the Victor problem as well as...!

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:52.660
All of Kazukin's problems will be resolved!

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:55.600
Tokiko?!

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:57.470
Thank goodness...

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:00.400
Tokiko...

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:04.710
l'm really...glad...

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.580
Answer me, brain.

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:12.550
What the hell did you use as a basis to develop this?

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:17.620
<i>You really are perceptive...</i>

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:20.990
<i>Also cold and cruel...</i>

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:37.500
<i>Although slight,</i> <i>l see the opposition has more power!</i>

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:56.620
Buster Knuckle!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:01.570
All right!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:02.430
Did that do it?!

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:11.140
Below?!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:23.720
He's undamaged?

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:26.920
This is going to be a long battle...

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:33.900
<i>As you surmised we used</i> <i>a black kakugane,</i>

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:35.660
<i>the same as the prototype...</i>

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:39.840
<i>The very last one of the three...</i>

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:42.670
How long would it take from now

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:47.700
to start refining a black kakugane from scratch and create another one?

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:52.580
<i>The process for refining the black kakugane</i> <i>was lost 100 years ago.</i>

00:19:53.650 --> 00:20:00.990
<i>lt would be almost impossible...</i> <i>to duplicate one from my aged brain.</i>

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:04.490
So basically, that means...

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:08.830
<i>There is one white kakugane</i> <i>for two Victors!</i>

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:11.670
<i>The one who can return to</i> <i>being human is either...</i>

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:15.510
<i>Victor or Kazuki Muto!</i>

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:22.610
<i>l will give you the white kakugane</i> <i>as soon as it is completed.</i>

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:25.480
<i>How you use this will be...</i>

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:29.760
<i>your decision, Kazuki.</i>

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:37.220
<i>Do you think alchemy can make</i> <i>everyone happy that easily?</i>

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:40.900
Further "decision is required."

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:47.670
You tried to protect me back then.

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:50.940
So this time I'll protect you.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:54.900
No matter what happens, you and l are of one body and soul.

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:58.480
Next episode, "Boy Meets Battle Girl."
